sion in 2023\"}]}, {\"v\": \"surveillance/descriptive\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"No. of AFP cases (NP AFP rate)*\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sewage samples collected monthly at these sites are tested for polioviruses and other enteroviruses.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analysis of the region coding the VP1 capsid protein of WPVs is used to classify them into genetic clusters\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A reported nonpolio acute flaccid paralysis (NPAFP) rate of ≥2 cases per 100,000 children aged <15 years is the WHO benchmark\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Stool specimens are considered adequate if two specimens are collected ≥24 hours apart within 14 days of paralysis onset\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"LQAS surveys seek evidence of vaccination (finger marking) by randomly selecting 60 children within each lot.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sewage samples collected monthly at these sites are tested for polioviruses and other enteroviruses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}